//RS /// A source-level `b.legacy` call declares the graph handles, while the
//RS /// canonical project file remains the authority for the wrapper command and
//RS /// discovered paths. Require the caller to repeat every imported fact in the
//RS /// typed call. This makes the production graph inspectable and prevents a
//RS /// stale source-side facade from silently discarding project-file semantics.
